% Building Habits (original series) - Aman Hambleton / chessbrah
% All 394 games from the 7 Lichess studies by SicilianSalad, chronological order.
% Event = opening name.  Site = Chess.com.
%
% VERIFICATION
% Chaptered episodes: every chapter marker was scored directly against each candidate game's
% true board-position sequence, and the pairing chosen by what the frames show - not by
% assuming games run consecutively. This revealed games played but never chaptered, and one
% chapter marker (Part 18, 0:45) that is an intro rather than a game.
% Unchaptered episodes: start times found by the same position matching, then audited for
% ordering, non-overlap, in-bounds timestamps, runtime coverage and plausible inter-game gaps.
%
% NOTE: these episodes are edited compilations - a single episode can splice footage from
% different recording days, so games in one episode are not always contiguous in real time.
%
% LinkPrecision "exact-chapter" - chapter marker, pairing verified against the video frames.
% LinkPrecision "matched"       - no chapter; start time found by position matching.
% LinkPrecision "shown-untimed" - game appears in the episode but has no chapter and no
%                                 confident frame match; links to the episode, no timestamp.
%
% Playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8N8j2e7RpPnpqbISqi1SJ9_wrnNU3rEm

